.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH soundcraft-cli-commands 1  "commands " 
.SH NAME
soundcraft\-cli\-commands \- List the engine commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsoundcraft\-cli commands\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILTER\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the engine commands
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print a JSON array of each command\*(Aqs details, as describe prints them
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILTER\fR]
Only the commands whose id, or label in any case, contains this text
